ith movement, jump and attack buttons<br><br>Features:<br><br>- 15 platformer levels with increasing difficulty<br>- 15 story scenes with images and dialogues<br>- Retro pixel art graphics of the platformer as well as realistic graphics in the story<br>- Familiar universe with well known characters from the game Horny Witch: Hunt",
